        <mxCell id="legend_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Tags trace to the Flow of Activities: A.1 / B.1 / C.1 = Actor column steps; A.1.1 / B.1.1 = System column steps;&lt;br&gt;A1 / B1 / C1 = Alternative Flow branches, placed at their Trigger point and routed back to their Resumption point.&lt;br&gt;Start, end and merge nodes are UML notation, not table rows. An empty diamond is a merge (no question, no labels).&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
